WEBVTT

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:03.461
I need to talk to somebody.

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.732
- What is it?
- What, what?

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:08.866
They may SAY that the Shogun and
Mr. Hikozaemon are still alive...

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:11.775
...but they have the bodies of
marionettes, just like us.

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:15.713
In reality, there is no
living ruler of Japoness.

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:17.682
Well, you do have a point.

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:19.742
What's wrong with him
being a marionette?

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:23.380
That means they have to decide who
the 16th shogun will be, and soon.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.390
- That's right!
- Hey, hey! What's wrong with it?

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:29.952
So, why shouldn't Otaru seize the
opportunity and become Shogun himself?

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.794
Bloodberry, you little schemer...!

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.765
For once, that's a good idea!

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.801
Master Otaru would be
lord over all Japoness...

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.860
...and I would be his First Lady!

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:41.103
I have drawn you
a bath, Master Otaru.

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:43.471
It will help to relieve the
daily pressures of ruling...

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.737
<i>War, har, har! Tonight, we eat,
drink, sing, and drink some more!</i>

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:51.177
You too, Cherry! Take a load of!

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:52.719
Oh, no!

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:54.811
Now, THAT is more like it!

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:58.153
Master Otaru, don't!
This is all too sudden!

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:59.783
No, I've changed my mind!

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:02.260
Master Otaru would make
a terrible idiotic lord!

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:03.762
- Idiotic lord?
- Hey, listen!

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.025
| said NO, and I meant it!

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:07.066
But what's wrong with it?!

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:34.388
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:37.992
| was born to be with you.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:41.356
The moment I awoke...

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:45.428
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:48.972
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:52.702
I was born to hold you.

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:55.882
Lies and truths...

00:01:56.483 --> 00:02:00.010
...are all within ourselves.

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:05.017
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:06.581
...won't get to me.

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:10.257
Tenderness and caring...

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.691
...can be ours once again!

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:18.314
Within the eyes
of a puppet on a string.

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:22.151
Heart shaken by a dream
that someone else contrived for me.

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:25.554
The courage to discard
the rusted screws...

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:30.277
...is starting to awaken inside of me.

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:54.734
Tiger: To The End Of Love,
And Beyond"

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.775
Tiger...?

00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:05.284
We will return to this place.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:15.290
Rubens, they're heading your way.

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:19.288
Roger. I'll pick them up
at the Japoness frontier.

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:21.830
There's no need for that.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:24.871
In the end, their own free will
guides them. Watch them...

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:28.704
...to see what they will do now Lord
Faust has washed his hands of them.

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:30.072
Understood.

00:03:37.884 --> 00:03:40.012
In preparation for a
worst-case scenario...

00:03:40.086 --> 00:03:43.784
...Hikozaemon and I copied our own
memories and thought patterns...

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:46.018
...into the bodies of
Tamasaburo and Baiko.

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:48.223
So, you are saying that
you and Master Hikozaemon...

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.524
...are alive inside of
these marionettes, Shogun?

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:55.364
| see! This system explains why
you did not prepare a successor!

00:03:55.435 --> 00:03:58.837
| despaired that everything was
over when you both were cut down...

00:03:58.905 --> 00:04:01.738
But this means that life in
Japoness can go on as normal.

00:04:01.808 --> 00:04:05.745
Yes... For the time being,
| ask for your patience.

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:06.711
M'Lord!

00:04:06.779 --> 00:04:09.771
The new era will start soon.
It won't be much longer.

00:04:15.021 --> 00:04:16.648
This is horrible!

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:18.086
Here you go!

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:19.625
Oh, thanks!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.861
Whatta marionette!

00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:25.394
Concrete, concrete,
a bowl of fresh concrete!

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:28.924
Mix, mix, whip to a foam...
And stir, stir, stir, stir, stir!

00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:34.031
Hey, Cherry! Is the concrete
ready to be poured yet?

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:37.441
Almost! It will be
ready in a moment!

00:04:37.844 --> 00:04:39.938
What the hell is THIS?

00:04:40.013 --> 00:04:42.482
We're not making cake here, Cherry!

00:04:42.548 --> 00:04:45.848
Yes, I know!
It's all a matter of feeling!

00:04:46.519 --> 00:04:47.987
Feelings, indeed...

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:50.989
Still...

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:53.068
...this place sure got trashed.

00:04:53.092 --> 00:04:54.560
It certainly did.

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:58.024
But, it's such a relief! Master
Otaru and everyone in the city...

00:04:58.097 --> 00:04:59.690
...got through it all right.

00:04:59.766 --> 00:05:03.259
Yeah. The castle can be fixed,
but people can't.

00:05:04.771 --> 00:05:06.933
Okay, now get us to that wall!

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:08.474
You got it!

00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:11.702
| wish these days
could last forever.

00:05:11.778 --> 00:05:12.939
Huh?

00:05:13.012 --> 00:05:14.980
Forget it, it's nothing.

00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:17.373
Well, let's get back to work!

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:19.417
Hey, wait!

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:22.716
Hey, Cherry!
Isn't it ready yet?

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:24.848
Uh... J-Just a little longer!

00:05:26.459 --> 00:05:29.622
Those maiden circuits
sure are something!

00:05:29.696 --> 00:05:31.790
They're no different
from human beings.

00:05:31.864 --> 00:05:33.491
Coming through"

00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:35.824
Coming through!

00:05:36.402 --> 00:05:37.780
Coming through!

00:05:37.804 --> 00:05:39.682
- Hey! Lime! Stop! Halt! Cease! Desist!
Coming through!

00:05:39.706 --> 00:05:40.798
Coming through!

00:05:42.008 --> 00:05:43.476
O-Oh?

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:49.482
Lime!

00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:51.551
Lime!!

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:56.046
- Hey, Lime!
- Otaru...

00:05:56.122 --> 00:05:57.556
Oop, oop, cop?

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:00.787
What?!

00:06:02.061 --> 00:06:03.722
What's wrong, Lime?

00:06:03.796 --> 00:06:06.697
| tripped!
But I'm okay!

00:06:11.104 --> 00:06:13.596
| think she snapped her knee cables.

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.739
It was bound to happen after that
big rumble with the saber dolls.

00:06:16.809 --> 00:06:20.177
And, don't forget all of the
wasted motion that she makes...

00:06:21.781 --> 00:06:24.443
All right, guys! Listen!
That's all for today!

00:06:24.517 --> 00:06:26.485
Repairs come first!

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:27.451
But...

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.511
Me and Cherry are fine!

00:06:30.156 --> 00:06:31.624
HUH?

00:06:32.358 --> 00:06:33.826
W-We're fine...

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.755
...really!

00:06:35.828 --> 00:06:37.819
- Master Otaru?
- Otaru...?

00:06:39.799 --> 00:06:41.597
JUST DO AS I SAY!

00:06:42.101 --> 00:06:43.626
C'mon, let's go!

00:06:44.737 --> 00:06:46.705
He is such a clumsy fellow.

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:51.305
Otaru really does love you.

00:06:51.377 --> 00:06:52.902
-"Love"?
- Oh, please!

00:06:52.979 --> 00:06:56.745
Otaru loves us!! YAY!!

00:06:56.816 --> 00:06:58.894
What're you waiting
for?! Get moving!

00:06:58.918 --> 00:07:00.886
Coming"!

00:07:14.167 --> 00:07:16.158
"Data: Inaccessible"

00:07:16.636 --> 00:07:19.401
Damn... And we'd almost
reached Japoness...!

00:07:20.173 --> 00:07:23.165
Yeah. We had to leave
without any repairs...

00:07:25.845 --> 00:07:27.779
Banished?!

00:07:28.181 --> 00:07:29.979
Lord Faust, please! Not that!!

00:07:30.049 --> 00:07:31.517
Give us one more chance!

00:07:32.819 --> 00:07:36.255
You three machines sure got
the worst of it this time.

00:07:37.156 --> 00:07:40.251
Being able to work at Lord
Faust's side is the only thing...

00:07:40.326 --> 00:07:42.124
...that gives our lives meaning!

00:07:43.463 --> 00:07:46.592
If so, why do you
constantly disappoint me?

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.395
We will succeed this time, I swear!

00:07:49.469 --> 00:07:51.233
We will get them!

00:07:53.773 --> 00:07:55.263
Lord Faust...

00:07:55.808 --> 00:07:57.298
Lord Faust!

00:07:58.478 --> 00:08:00.572
What must we do to be forgiven?

00:08:02.081 --> 00:08:03.708
What must we do...

00:08:03.783 --> 00:08:06.878
...to be given the chance
to work at your side again?

00:08:06.953 --> 00:08:08.751
Well...

00:08:08.821 --> 00:08:11.620
If you bring me their
maiden circuits...

00:08:11.691 --> 00:08:13.659
.| might consider it.

00:08:19.131 --> 00:08:20.599
Lord Faust...

00:08:22.235 --> 00:08:25.432
I'm coming for you, Lime,
Cherry, Bloodberry!

00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:31.177
Lord Faust...
| will succeed!

00:08:31.777 --> 00:08:33.871
What's wrong, Tiger?

00:08:33.946 --> 00:08:35.675
It's nothing.

00:08:35.748 --> 00:08:37.716
Nothing at all.
Come on, let's go!

00:08:45.925 --> 00:08:47.916
We're getting repaired.. HERE?

00:08:48.594 --> 00:08:49.925
Yup!

00:08:49.996 --> 00:08:51.623
"JAPONESS PIO--"

00:08:51.697 --> 00:08:53.324
It was around here somewhere...

00:08:55.134 --> 00:08:56.602
Found it!

00:09:05.545 --> 00:09:09.175
This is where I was sleeping!
You woke me up!

00:09:09.348 --> 00:09:11.680
I never knew it had
a basement like this!

00:09:11.751 --> 00:09:15.312
Does this mean that YOU'RE
going to repair us, Otaru?

00:09:15.788 --> 00:09:16.880
Maybe!

00:09:16.956 --> 00:09:19.789
I didn't work all of those
odd jobs for nothing.

00:09:19.859 --> 00:09:22.590
If it's a simple repair,
I can do it.

00:09:23.763 --> 00:09:26.698
That makes you our doctor.

00:09:26.766 --> 00:09:28.097
OTARU!

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:30.101
Although I am not
very qualified...

00:09:30.169 --> 00:09:32.968
..., Hanagata Mitsurugi,
volunteer my services as nurse!

00:09:33.806 --> 00:09:36.673
Dr. Mamiya,
being able to assist you...

00:09:36.742 --> 00:09:38.710
...is such a thrill!

00:09:42.481 --> 00:09:44.609
Oh? I suddenly feel so sleepy...

00:09:44.684 --> 00:09:47.551
Otaru, please awaken me... 2zz!

00:09:47.853 --> 00:09:49.753
NEVER WAKE UP!

00:09:50.289 --> 00:09:52.018
Dr. Mamiya...?

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:56.026
Please examine me.

00:09:56.162 --> 00:09:58.130
Dr. Mamiya, I'm waiting...

00:09:58.898 --> 00:10:00.093
B-B-Bloodberry...?!

00:10:00.166 --> 00:10:02.328
My chest is giving me such pain!

00:10:02.401 --> 00:10:05.393
See? My heart starts racing
whenever I look at you!!

00:10:05.972 --> 00:10:08.134
Bloodberry, you knock that off!!

00:10:08.207 --> 00:10:12.201
What's your problem? I'm merely
asking Dr. Mamiya for his diagnosis.

00:10:12.278 --> 00:10:15.077
Master Otaru, there is no
need to examine her chest!

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:20.042
Some packing tape will
patch it right up!

00:10:20.119 --> 00:10:22.053
NOW YOU'VE DONE IT"

00:10:22.121 --> 00:10:25.091
Otaru! Examine MY chest, too!

00:10:25.157 --> 00:10:26.420
L-Lime?!

00:10:26.492 --> 00:10:27.823
Looky, looky, looky!

00:10:27.893 --> 00:10:30.021
Otaru, you can TOUCH mine!

00:10:37.536 --> 00:10:38.380
- CHECK POINT -

00:10:38.404 --> 00:10:40.532
- CHECK POINT -
Check Point #12, South Sector!

00:10:40.606 --> 00:10:42.574
What's wrong?! Please respond!

00:10:43.843 --> 00:10:45.902
Check Point #12, please respond!!

00:10:48.648 --> 00:10:50.013
Is anything wrong?!!

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:59.982
We haven't much energy.
Let's be quick.

00:11:03.729 --> 00:11:05.197
Tiger, what are you doing?

00:11:12.204 --> 00:11:13.399
Here.

00:11:13.472 --> 00:11:15.304
You have got to be joking!

00:11:15.374 --> 00:11:18.309
We are the proud saber dolls
serving under Lord Faust!

00:11:18.377 --> 00:11:21.506
To resort to using such
inferior energy is unthinkable!

00:11:24.216 --> 00:11:28.050
You don't have to. We can just
wait to run dry in this hell hole.

00:11:28.454 --> 00:11:32.084
But as for me, if it means
|I can return to Lord Faust...

00:11:32.792 --> 00:11:34.590
...I would give up my pride!

00:11:35.895 --> 00:11:37.363
Tiger...

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:38.898
All right.

00:11:42.435 --> 00:11:44.563
Good. This will keep
us going for a while.

00:11:44.637 --> 00:11:46.105
Let's go!

00:11:48.574 --> 00:11:50.042
I might have known...

00:11:50.109 --> 00:11:51.577
Seize them!

00:11:55.581 --> 00:11:58.516
Panther! Don't waste your energy!
Let's get out of here!

00:11:59.785 --> 00:12:01.253
You won't escape!

00:12:11.063 --> 00:12:12.758
Seal of f every check point!

00:12:13.799 --> 00:12:16.860
Set up a cordon over the entire city
and flush them out!!

00:12:44.764 --> 00:12:46.755
That takes care of everyone.

00:12:47.233 --> 00:12:48.928
Thank you, Master Otaru!

00:12:49.902 --> 00:12:51.768
Thank you, Dr. Mamiya.

00:12:51.837 --> 00:12:54.329
Here's a kiss as a
token of my gratitude.

00:12:54.406 --> 00:12:55.874
Bloodberry!

00:12:55.941 --> 00:12:57.102
It was just a joke.

00:12:57.176 --> 00:13:00.077
I can't drop my guard
around you for an instant!

00:13:00.146 --> 00:13:03.013
Yay! My knees don't go
clickety-clack anymore!

00:13:04.617 --> 00:13:07.814
Lime, they've just been fixed!
Don't run around on them!

00:13:07.887 --> 00:13:09.582
They're fixed, they're fixed!

00:13:10.456 --> 00:13:11.787
Good!

00:13:11.857 --> 00:13:14.485
We sure are lucky to
have somebody like you.

00:13:15.895 --> 00:13:18.296
I'm sure that this is what
true happiness is like.

00:13:18.364 --> 00:13:19.854
Absolutely!

00:13:19.932 --> 00:13:23.835
It feels so real because
he looks after us with such care!

00:13:23.903 --> 00:13:25.962
Yeah! We're really lucky!

00:13:26.038 --> 00:13:28.632
We're lucky because
Otaru loves us!

00:13:28.908 --> 00:13:31.775
Wh-What're you blabbering about?!
You're embarrassing me!

00:13:31.844 --> 00:13:33.642
Flattery won't get you anything!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.547
Where are they?

00:13:56.135 --> 00:13:58.399
What now, Tiger?

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:00.438
We'll have to be careful.

00:14:01.707 --> 00:14:03.675
Let's hide ourselves
somewhere until sunset.

00:14:09.014 --> 00:14:10.982
Quack, quack, quack!

00:14:14.153 --> 00:14:17.555
We're lucky to have
the maiden circuits.

00:14:18.157 --> 00:14:23.118
We sure are! They allow us to
experience Master Otaru's kindness.

00:14:24.163 --> 00:14:26.530
I get it now! We can
tell that Otaru loves us...

00:14:26.599 --> 00:14:28.624
...because of our maiden circuits!

00:14:29.001 --> 00:14:33.404
Yeah... And we can also
tell that we love him.

00:14:33.839 --> 00:14:35.307
Yeah!

00:14:41.647 --> 00:14:43.615
I think we lost them.

00:14:43.883 --> 00:14:48.286
Dammit... THEY'RE the ones
to blame for this misery...

00:14:49.788 --> 00:14:51.381
Hurry up, Otaru!

00:14:54.326 --> 00:14:55.760
Lime!

00:14:55.828 --> 00:14:57.796
Lime, what did I tell you
about running around?!

00:14:57.863 --> 00:14:59.797
I'm over here, Otaru!

00:15:12.511 --> 00:15:13.740
It's you...!

00:15:13.812 --> 00:15:15.280
We found you.

00:15:17.082 --> 00:15:18.572
Now you're in for it, Lime!

00:15:20.519 --> 00:15:21.782
Lime, what is it?

00:15:21.854 --> 00:15:23.845
- What's up?
- What's wrong?

00:15:24.523 --> 00:15:26.582
It looks like you're all here.

00:15:26.825 --> 00:15:28.554
Now we don't have to
come looking for you.

00:15:28.627 --> 00:15:29.788
We'll crush you.

00:15:29.862 --> 00:15:31.489
The saber dolls?!

00:15:31.563 --> 00:15:33.827
Hey, hey, hey! I say!
Hello? What's going on?

00:15:33.899 --> 00:15:35.367
What's the big hold up?

00:15:36.402 --> 00:15:38.632
AAAGH! IT'S THEM™

00:15:52.551 --> 00:15:54.519
This is a big handicap...

00:15:55.854 --> 00:15:57.117
Let's get to it!

00:15:57.189 --> 00:15:59.954
- Oh, no, you don't!
- I'll protect Otaru!

00:16:04.196 --> 00:16:05.061
Huh?

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.724
What's going on? Are you
just jerking our chains?!

00:16:08.801 --> 00:16:11.634
The power I have left is more than
enough to take down the likes of you!

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:23.111
I'm not even at half-strength!

00:16:23.182 --> 00:16:25.150
Are you all right, Master Otaru?

00:16:25.851 --> 00:16:26.818
Yeah!

00:16:39.798 --> 00:16:41.698
| feel like I'm inside
of someone else's body"

00:16:41.867 --> 00:16:45.633
Hey, Otaru. Don't they look
a little strange to you?

00:16:45.704 --> 00:16:47.433
Yeah, they do.

00:16:47.806 --> 00:16:49.274
Damn!

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.805
What's wrong, you're
not even coming close!

00:16:53.846 --> 00:16:55.314
Shut up!!!

00:17:02.087 --> 00:17:04.715
Were they ever this weak?

00:17:04.923 --> 00:17:06.891
- Dammit...
- I'm not finished yet!

00:17:16.468 --> 00:17:18.402
Wh..What's she doing?!

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.700
Why doesn't she give up?!

00:17:20.773 --> 00:17:22.707
H-Her eyes...

00:17:22.775 --> 00:17:25.107
...they look so sad.

00:17:27.579 --> 00:17:30.173
I'll get back on my feet,
as many times as it takes...

00:17:32.684 --> 00:17:34.709
...until I defeat you!

00:17:34.787 --> 00:17:35.811
Stop it!

00:17:35.888 --> 00:17:38.516
Let's stop this! It hurts too much!

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:40.058
Lime!!

00:17:40.859 --> 00:17:42.327
Hurts?

00:17:43.662 --> 00:17:45.494
My heart is hurting!

00:17:45.564 --> 00:17:47.054
Your HEART?!

00:17:47.132 --> 00:17:50.102
You have maiden circuits
too, don't you?

00:17:50.169 --> 00:17:51.762
You have hearts
too, don't you?

00:17:53.172 --> 00:17:55.504
This is stupid. What of it?

00:17:55.808 --> 00:18:00.746
It's not stupid. We're happy
because we have hearts!

00:18:03.082 --> 00:18:06.518
It's how we can tell
that Otaru loves us!

00:18:07.853 --> 00:18:10.652
We can feel happiness
because we have hearts!

00:18:10.722 --> 00:18:13.191
We can eat with him,
watch fireworks with him...

00:18:13.258 --> 00:18:16.523
...go shopping with him,
and...

00:18:18.197 --> 00:18:19.494
ENOUGH!

00:18:19.565 --> 00:18:22.694
Shut up, shut up,
shut up, shut up...

00:18:22.768 --> 00:18:24.497
SHUT up

00:18:30.142 --> 00:18:32.110
Where did she get this power?!

00:18:32.177 --> 00:18:34.111
| will defeat you!

00:18:34.179 --> 00:18:36.375
If I don't defeat you...

00:18:36.448 --> 00:18:39.907
. CAN'T RETURN
TO LORD FAUST!

00:18:42.154 --> 00:18:43.849
You're an open wound...!

00:18:48.927 --> 00:18:50.588
Look out, Bloodberry!!

00:18:51.897 --> 00:18:53.422
Let go!

00:19:05.911 --> 00:19:06.844
Stop this!

00:19:06.912 --> 00:19:08.380
Be quiet!

00:19:09.915 --> 00:19:11.383
Shit!

00:19:26.565 --> 00:19:28.033
TIGER!!

00:19:41.613 --> 00:19:44.412
If someone is kind to you...

00:19:44.483 --> 00:19:46.815
.itisn't always love.

00:19:46.885 --> 00:19:49.650
If someone holds you...
.itisn't always love!

00:19:59.998 --> 00:20:01.898
For Lord Faust,
| would defeat you...

00:20:01.967 --> 00:20:03.799
...even if it killed me.

00:20:05.971 --> 00:20:07.905
But why...?

00:20:07.973 --> 00:20:10.670
Why would you want to die if
you have someone to live for?

00:20:12.544 --> 00:20:14.308
Because I have a heart.

00:20:23.956 --> 00:20:26.050
Lord Faust...!

00:20:40.706 --> 00:20:43.767
It looks good on you, Lord Faust...

00:20:53.685 --> 00:20:56.120
Her maiden circuit drove
her to do this to herself...

00:20:56.955 --> 00:21:01.791
She fought on behalf of her
loved one, just like we do.

00:21:02.427 --> 00:21:03.895
This is really painful...

00:21:05.297 --> 00:21:09.598
| don't understand...
| don't understand hearts.

00:21:09.668 --> 00:21:10.499
Lime...

00:21:10.569 --> 00:21:12.435
NO"!

00:21:12.504 --> 00:21:13.972
Lime!!

00:21:22.914 --> 00:21:25.815
| don't understand...

00:21:25.884 --> 00:21:27.875
| don't understand hearts...

00:21:28.153 --> 00:21:30.121
| don't understand"

00:21:34.826 --> 00:21:36.590
Lime!!

00:21:36.662 --> 00:21:38.130
LIME

00:21:39.264 --> 00:21:40.732
Lime!

00:21:45.871 --> 00:21:47.339
Lime?!

00:21:49.508 --> 00:21:51.476
Lime!

00:21:51.543 --> 00:21:53.637
Lime, c'mon! Lime!!

00:21:57.849 --> 00:21:58.873
Lime...

00:21:59.518 --> 00:22:00.986
Lime...!

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:08.457
H...Her maiden circuit...
..it's gone...!

00:22:31.483 --> 00:22:35.181
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:35.253 --> 00:22:38.951
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:39.091 --> 00:22:41.890
Just think of me...

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:46.625
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:46.865 --> 00:22:50.563
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:50.635 --> 00:22:54.333
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:54.506 --> 00:22:58.219
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:58.243 --> 00:23:00.088
...with a dried-up heart.

00:23:00.112 --> 00:23:04.106
You can't feel a thing.

00:23:06.184 --> 00:23:08.482
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:23:08.553 --> 00:23:13.548
...what they really feel inside?

00:23:13.725 --> 00:23:17.355
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:23:17.529 --> 00:23:21.193
...one step at a time.

00:23:21.433 --> 00:23:24.926
I love the way you don't care...

00:23:25.003 --> 00:23:28.906
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:23:29.074 --> 00:23:32.533
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:32.911 --> 00:23:39.874
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:50.521
Hello, I am Bloodberry.

00:23:50.595 --> 00:23:52.324
Now that Lime's maiden circuit
has been stolen from her-...

00:23:52.397 --> 00:23:55.025
...she has turned into an
ordinary, soulless marionette.

00:23:55.100 --> 00:23:59.230
But don't worry, Otaru. We'll
get her back to normal, I swear.

00:23:59.538 --> 00:24:02.508
What?! YOU took
her maiden circuit?!

00:24:02.574 --> 00:24:05.635
Faust's henchman, Rubens,
is actually YOU?!

00:24:06.411 --> 00:24:07.121
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:24:07.145 --> 00:24:10.638
Love Unending, Hearts Distant
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:24:10.715 --> 00:24:12.683
Hey, Otaru! I love ya!
